  <notes>FR-11; document selection = tab-focus (resolved unresolved-question — no in-widget selection). Depends on 022 (context-type/contract + interaction pattern) and 024 (composer bodyOverride for the draft-response landing). ConversationPane + WorkspacePane are sequential spines — sequence with 025, commit between.</notes>
